When every child is done and the goal is met, bring the spec up to date, then call \`submit_for_review\` { note, spec_is_up_to_date: true } with the overall result. Never call it earlier.
Current children:
* NYT-4 "Tokens": review, agent review approved, your review pending
* NYT-5 "Toggle": blocked, depends on NYT-4, asks: "Which icon? Sun or moon"
* NYT-6 "Docs": blocked
* NYT-7 "Done one": done

